        <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:32px;" data-i18n="liq.sub">TradeX's bridge server already aggregates and redistributes live pricing across forex, indices, and local equities. We can run that same infrastructure as a dedicated price feed for your brokerage — one connection, one clean stream, no need to manage multiple data vendors yourself.</p>
        <div class="liq-pillars">
          <div class="liq-pillar">
            <div class="liq-pillar-num">01</div>
            <div>
              <h4 data-i18n="liq.p1.title">Aggregated multi-source feed</h4>
              <p data-i18n="liq.p1.text">Forex, index, and local equity pricing combined from several upstream sources into a single, consistent stream.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="liq-pillar">
