              <h4 data-i18n="liq.p2.title">Low-latency distribution</h4>
              <p data-i18n="liq.p2.text">One upstream connection is held once and broadcast to every downstream client, removing the tick-coalescing delay that comes from each client polling separately.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="liq-pillar">
            <div class="liq-pillar-num">03</div>
            <div>
              <h4 data-i18n="liq.p3.title">Built to keep running</h4>
              <p data-i18n="liq.p3.text">Symbol tombstones, transactional writes, and a dedicated relay layer — the same hardening already running in production on TradeX.</p>
            </div>
