<section class="arch" id="architecture">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="arch-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="section-eyebrow" data-i18n="arch.eyebrow">Architecture</div>
        <h2 style="margin-bottom:16px;" data-i18n="arch.h2">Not a showcase — infrastructure running in production</h2>
        <p class="section-sub" style="margin-bottom:0;" data-i18n="arch.sub">TradeX isn't a prototype. It's a system where bugs surfaced by real customer complaints get fixed, performance regressions get resolved, and real trading volume has already put it to the test.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="arch-list">
        <div class="arch-row">
          <div class="arch-tag" data-i18n="arch.tag1">DATA LAYER</div>
          <div>
            <h4 data-i18n="arch.row1.title">Firestore + Realtime Database</h4>
            <p data-i18n="arch.row1.text">Position open/close and heartbeat operations are protected by transactions, eliminating the risk of accidentally overwriting stale data.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="arch-row">
          <div class="arch-tag" data-i18n="arch.tag2">PRICE FEED</div>
          <div>
            <h4 data-i18n="arch.row2.title">Custom Bridge Server (Railway)</h4>
            <p data-i18n="arch.row2.text">A Node.js bridge distributes prices to every trader over a single WebSocket connection, eliminating tick latency. Supports multiple data sources across local equities, indices, and forex.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="arch-row">
          <div class="arch-tag" data-i18n="arch.tag3">PERFORMANCE</div>
          <div>
            <h4 data-i18n="arch.row3.title">Smooth UI at 179+ Symbols</h4>
            <p data-i18n="arch.row3.text">Bottlenecks caused by forced synchronous DOM reflows have been eliminated, so the interface stays responsive even with a high symbol count.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="arch-row">
          <div class="arch-tag" data-i18n="arch.tag4">RELIABILITY</div>
          <div>
            <h4 data-i18n="arch.row4.title">Symbol Tombstones &amp; Audit Log</h4>
            <p data-i18n="arch.row4.text">A tombstone system for removed symbols, plus a Cloud Function-based audit log for every transaction.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:48px;">
      <div class="arch-panel">
        <div class="line"><span data-i18n="arch.line1">Firestore transaction hardening</span><span class="ok" data-i18n="arch.active">active</span></div>
        <div class="line"><span data-i18n="arch.line2">Bridge server tick-coalescing fix</span><span class="ok" data-i18n="arch.active">active</span></div>
